pgsim 1
# A shot: a campfire on the bank of a pond, in the rain. The gusts that lay
# the flames over and carry the smoke away also slant the rain and carry
# the spray off; the drops ring the water and splash off the ground, and the
# ground shines wet. The pond is sunk into the ground: blocks as high as the
# bank round it. Rendered through the camera, low over the water.
